  "disclaimer": "capability_tier is a LOCAL EDITORIAL ESTIMATE maintained in this file. It is NOT a benchmark score and this product must never present it as one. speed_tier is likewise editorial and is superseded at runtime by measured tokens/sec whenever this installation has observed enough calls (see src/usage/telemetry.mjs). Cost figures are never stored here - they come from the gateway's pricing API or are reported as unknown.",
